sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant G as Gmail
  participant API as API (webhook)
  participant SCH as Scheduler and triggers
  participant RUN as Run engine
  participant DB as Postgres
  actor Ali as Ali
  G->>API: push: a new email arrived
  API->>SCH: trigger new_email for bots that subscribed
  SCH->>DB: skip duplicates (message id), save the cursor
  SCH->>RUN: start a run (bot = Inbox, input = the email, marked untrusted)
  RUN->>RUN: read and label (auto), draft a reply (auto)
  RUN->>RUN: send the reply: policy says ASK (untrusted input keeps it ask)
  RUN->>DB: approval request + checkpoint
  RUN-->>Ali: notification + approval card
  Note over SCH: Routines work the same way,<br/>started by the clock instead of an email
